<introText_m>
You meet with $m.getName() at a cafe to get some coffee.

It is quite busy, and the two of you have to stand for a few minutes before you are able to get some seats. The two of you end up crammed together at a tiny, wobbly table.

#if ($w.hasTrait("SHY") && $m.hasTrait("TACITURN"))##
