#elseif (!$w.hasTrait("SHY") && $m.hasTrait("TACITURN"))##
You tell $m.getName() all about your day. He nods quietly. He's such a good listener.
#else##
The two of you chat about your day.
#end##
$m.addEnjoyTiny() $m.addNpcLikingTiny() $m.addWLikingTiny()##
